Benzyl chloride hydrolysis k_OH ~ 5e-5? Let's estimate. Benzyl chloride + OH- SN2 in water: k2 maybe 5×10^-5 M^-1 s^-1? Actually benzyl chloride solvolysis in 50% acetone at 50°C? Hmm. Benzyl chloride hydrolysis in 80% aqueous acetone at 30°C k ~1e-5 s^-1? With OH- maybe 0.1 M^-1 s^-1? Not sure. 2,4-DNCB + OH- maybe k ~2×10^-2 M^-1 s^-1? Could be comparable.

