ΔG°f Fe2O3 = -177 kcal/mol (per mole Fe2O3, since reaction 1 forms 1 mol Fe2O3 from elements).

Reaction 2: 4 Fe2O3 + Fe → 3 Fe3O4, ΔG = -19 kcal.

ΔG = 3ΔGf(Fe3O4) - 4(-177) = -19
